  "_about": "a great white pelican: big and white with a blush of pink, a pale yellow patch on the breast; the long bill hooked at the tip and the yellow pouch slung under it, the bare yellowish face; the black flight feathers showing along the folded wing and the whole black trailing half of the wing aloft, nearly three metres across; short orange-pink legs and webbed feet (2026-11-08, review.py: bill) The bill: a long flat upper mandible ending in a short nail bent down at its very tip (it curled back into a C), the lower run on to just behind the nail. (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sweep/necks.py) The NECK is one `sweep` (sculpt.js) along the chain of neck bones, not a tube a bone blended into the next: no bead at the joints.",
